00:44:34.220 --> 00:44:39.220
But what I think is not
very clearly and widely

00:44:39.510 --> 00:44:43.040
recognized and including by myself,

00:44:43.040 --> 00:44:46.060
until really working on this paper, right?

00:44:46.060 --> 00:44:48.830
Is the connection
between those two issues.

00:44:48.830 --> 00:44:51.925
So is Marx's theory a bad kind of,

00:44:51.925 --> 00:44:54.180
well, I mean, I would say Marx's theory

00:44:54.180 --> 00:44:56.807
is mainly about surplus value, right?

00:44:57.920 --> 00:45:00.320
But then equilibrium prices or

00:45:01.260 --> 00:45:04.770
assume in order and explain

00:45:04.770 --> 00:45:07.590
in order ultimately not to
explain equilibrium prices,

00:45:07.590 --> 00:45:09.800
but to explain surplus value

00:45:09.800 --> 00:45:14.010
- And how does it change our
understanding of surplus value

00:45:14.010 --> 00:45:18.650
to think that value is created

00:45:18.650 --> 00:45:21.911
