00:45:21.911 --> 00:45:24.810
with no additional inputs?

00:45:24.810 --> 00:45:29.810
- Okay, the Marx's
theory of surplus value,

00:45:30.030 --> 00:45:33.289
the inner law as he called it,

00:45:33.289 --> 00:45:37.227
surplus value is determined
