00:45:52.750 --> 00:45:57.750
But, if surplus value also
depends on the market, right?

00:46:00.760 --> 00:46:05.760
On demand, that is what Marx called

00:46:06.010 --> 00:46:08.883
a distracting influence, right?

00:46:11.081 --> 00:46:16.081
And is a less strong
theory of the inner law

00:46:19.300 --> 00:46:22.320
