00:46:40.406 --> 00:46:45.406
or makes exploitation a graver issue

00:46:47.191 --> 00:46:51.790
or a more emphatic problem in capital.

00:46:51.790 --> 00:46:54.413
So, I appreciate your clarifying that.

00:46:54.413 --> 00:46:56.047
